    "title": "Reading residents to receive free admission to Schlegel Pool Thursday and Friday amid extreme heat - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Berks Weekly ,\n10 hours ago Reading residents will be able to cool off at no cost this week as the city responds to dangerous heat expected across the region. Mayor Eddie Morán announced Wednesday that admission to Schlegel Pool will be free for City of Reading residents on Thursday, July 2, and Friday, July 3, from noon to 7 p.m. due to the ongoing Extreme Heat Warning. Read full article\n2",
